  "summary": "Trunk subsegment mass parameters with vertebral-level boundaries.",
  "how_to_use": [
   "For a model segmented at T12/L1 and L5/S1, assign thorax 18.5 %, lumbar region 12.2 %, pelvis 10.7 % body mass (trunk 41.4 %).",
